<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>The Mohéli Crisis, 1999</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;In history, a bloodless coup took place in Comoros in 1999.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;This scenario assumes the 1999 coup was more violent and chaotic.&amp;nbsp; Rebels have seized control of the island of Mohéli.&amp;nbsp; French nationals living on the island have been taken hostage and the rebels are threatening to kill them&amp;nbsp;unless their demands are met--the rebels believe that France will pressure other factions in the Comoros in order to protect their citizens.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;As might be expected, France&amp;nbsp;has taken&amp;nbsp;a dim view of these actions.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;-------------------------------------------------------&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;Comoros' navy in 1999 consisted of two &lt;EM&gt;Yamayuri&lt;/EM&gt;-class patrol boats.&amp;nbsp; At the time this scenario was written, the &lt;EM&gt;Yamayuri&lt;/EM&gt;-class was not&amp;nbsp;available in the DB3000 database.&amp;nbsp; The Israeli &lt;EM&gt;Dabur&lt;/EM&gt;-class was a reasonably good subsitutute, so it has been used instead, with&amp;nbsp;appropriately modified weaponry&amp;nbsp;(i.e., the 20-mm. cannon has been replaced with a twin 12.7-mm heavy machine gun and the 7.62-mm machine guns have been removed).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;Delivering paratroopers can be modeled in Command by first using a Teleport action to move troops to a desired location, and&amp;nbsp;then using a combination of a Delete Unit lua script action and an Add Unit lua script action to replace the aircraft&amp;nbsp;that have paratrooper loadouts with aircraft that have Ferry loadouts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to any future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
